{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119878","id":3770268812,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7gubyM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119878","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119878.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119878.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119878","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119878/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119878/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119878/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5259c84601a4527171b6762dec154fc8e3c7bc00","number":119878,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add size-based UV scaling for CSG nodes","user":{"login":"artificioh","id":101995884,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhRVbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101995884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh","html_url":"https://github.com/artificioh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117202\r\n- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119696\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14133\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an option to scale the UVs generated by `CSGPrimitive3D` nodes to match their size, avoiding the need to use triplanar UVs. I used the fixes for `CSGCylinder3D` and `CSGTorus3D` UVs from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117202 by @Jesusemora, branching from their PR.\r\n\r\n~~Unlike my [previous PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119696) I decided not to include `uv_offset` and `uv_scale` in this one. Mainly because each type would require a custom way of changing such options (`CSGCylinder3D` for example would have 4 `Vector2`s, for controlling offset and scale for the side faces and the cap faces separately), but also because controlling UVs per face together with a per face material override would be better in a future PR.~~\r\n\r\n- Implemented simple `uv_scale` and `uv_offset` as `Vector2`s that are applied equally to all faces.\r\n- Added `uv_match_size` property to `CSGPrimitive3D` for toggling UV scaling\r\n- `CSGMesh3D` is not affected by `uv_match_size`\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n|<img width=\"1247\" height=\"624\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b817680-f358-41ac-9e1b-30b00fcfee32\" />|<img width=\"1241\" height=\"621\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bffaadc6-59d4-4549-849f-a2523904adbf\" />|\r\n\r\n| Type | Demo |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| `CSGBox3D` |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"box\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50c3e828-928e-41ca-ba92-f4f5f36db033\" />|\r\n| `CSGSphere3D`, `CSGCylinder3D` |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"cone_cylinder_sphere\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c249b24b-23e5-49d1-b477-a0d6edf84beb\" />|\r\n| `CSGTorus3D` |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"torus\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b16e5bf6-8d4f-4385-ac4a-adb675f5d70d\" />|\r\n| `CSGPolygon3D` (path)  |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"polygon_path\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2703da20-2d38-4141-ac05-3ccd1cf3b97d\" />|\r\n| `CSGPolygon3D` (spin)  |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"polygon_spin\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7f648ae-2868-4468-9c47-891490b53d9c\" />|\r\n| `CSGPolygon3D` (depth) |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"polygon_depth\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25cedbd9-d67d-4f69-a159-9504396a1680\" />|  \r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht